<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/learning-management-systems> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ERIC scope note: Computer software used to manage, deliver, track, and report on educational programs and their outcomes." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-management-systems/versions/1> .
