<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/learning-management-systems> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Software platforms used to administer, deliver, organize, track, and report on learning activities, courses, and associated outcomes." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-management-systems/versions/1> .
